@@@ forum-038
type: forum_thread
title: Carrier on 2182 again (LB-208)
author: eward
date: 1999-08-21T23:47:00-07:00
path: /forum/signals/thread_038.html
role: critical
links: /logbook/LB-208.html
---
[eward | 08/21/99 23:47]
Second time this month. Carrier on 2182, and this time I swear there was a voice under it for a second. Logged as LB-208.
Is anybody else even listening anymore? I posted LB-204 two weeks ago and got zero replies.
This place used to be alive. In 1998 a log like this would have had twenty replies by morning.

[saltmarsh | 08/22/99 07:12]
I'm here, Eli. Summer is slow. Everyone's outside.

[eward | 08/22/99 09:40]
I know. Sorry. It's been a bad year. I just don't want this place to go quiet too.

[keeper | 08/22/99 12:03]
We're not going anywhere. Keep logging. If it's there, it'll come back.

