date: 1999-08-30T22:15:00-07:00
path: /forum/admin/thread_003.html
role: critical
---
[sysop_ray | 08/30/99 22:15]
Mara - beacon's disk is dying. Kernel log is full of "hda: dma_intr: status=0x51 { DriveReady SeekComplete Error }". It's the original 1996 drive.
Plan: move everything to a rack box at NorthCoast Colo in Seattle. They can give me a slot the weekend of Oct 16-17.
I'll do a full backup to DAT tape Saturday night, restore it on the new box Sunday. Expect a few hours down. Nothing will be lost.

[keeper | 08/31/99 07:40]
Thank you Ray. Weekend of the 16th is fine. Do we need to tell people?

[sysop_ray | 08/31/99 08:02]
Put a line on the front page closer to the date. And please don't let anyone upload huge files before then, the disk is full-ish.

